          ],
          "content": "**Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.159,
            0.391,
            0.178
          ],
          "content": "**Q1. Find the missing numbers:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.186,
            0.883,
            0.223
          ],
          "content": "**a. 5 glasses of juice shared equally among 4 friends is the same as \\_\\_\\_\\_ glasses of juice shared equally among 8 friends.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.232,
            0.303,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": "\\mathrm { S 0 } , \\quad { \\frac { 5 } { 4 } } = { \\frac { \\pi } { 8 } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_43_equation_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.272,
            0.193,
            0.29
          ],
          "content": "Ans. 10"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.299,
            0.881,
            0.336
          ],
          "content": "**b. 4 kg of potatoes divided equally in 3 bags is the same as 12 kgs of potatoes divided equally in \\_\\_ bags.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.344,
            0.297,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": "\\mathrm { S o } , { \\frac { 4 } { 3 } }   =   { \\frac { 1 2 } { } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_43_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.384,
            0.178,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": "Ans. 9"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.411,
            0.881,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": "c. 7 rotis divided among 5 children is the same as\\_\\_\\_\\_rotis divided among **children.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.457,
            0.291,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": "\\mathrm { S o } , { \\frac { 7 } { 5 } } = -",
          "image_source": "images/page_43_equation_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.497,
            0.651,
            0.516
          ],
          "content": "Ans. One of the choices is 14, 10 (Try for other options also.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.552,
            0.234,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": "**Page no. 170**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.577,
            0.25,
            0.599
          ],
          "content": "**Section 7.6**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.608,
            0.883,
            0.662
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Suppose the number of children is kept the same, but the number of units that are being shared is increased? What can you say about each child’s share now? Why? Discuss how your reasoning explains**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.67,
            0.393,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{1}{5} < \\frac{2}{5}, \\quad \\frac{3}{7} < \\frac{4}{7}   and   \\frac{1}{2} < \\frac{5}{8}",
          "image_source": "images/page_43_equation_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.711,
            0.476,
            0.729
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Each child will have larger share now."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.737,
            0.882,
            0.775
          ],
          "content": "If the number of units to be shared increase with same number of children then each child will have larger share."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.783,
            0.778,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Now, decide in which of the two groups will each child get a larger share:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.809,
            0.791,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": "**1. Group 1: 3 glasses of sugarcane juice divided equally among 4 children.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.837,
            0.81,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": "**Group 2: 7 glasses of sugarcane juice divided equally among 10 children.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.864,
            0.791,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": "**2. Group 1: 4 glasses of sugarcane juice divided equally among 7 children.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.891,
            0.801,
            0.911
          ],
          "content": "**Group 2: 5 glasses of sugarcane juice divided equally among 7 children.**"
        }
      ]
